        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core CPU (e.g., Intel Core i5/i7 or AMD Ryzen 5)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Discrete GPU with OpenGL 3.3 support (e.g., NVIDIA GTX 750 or AMD Radeon HD 7850)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A</li></ul>"
